    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a rocket with 5 thrusters that can be activated individually. The goal is simple: land on the blue platform. Will you be able to keep control while getting there?\u00a0Touch anything and you'll have to start over again. Play by yourself or with your friends locally by letting each player control a thruster.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>38 challenging levels</strong>: Land the rocket with precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Force fields and collectables that make your life harder than it already is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer mode</strong>: Control the rocket by yourself and find a way to overcome the obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer mode</strong>: Each player gets a thruster (or more than one). Will you rely on collective intelligence or will someone take the lead?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best times:</strong>\u00a0Best times are tracked for each level.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a rocket with 5 thrusters that can be activated individually. The goal is simple: land on the blue platform. Will you be able to keep control while getting there?\u00a0Touch anything and you'll have to start over again. Play by yourself or with your friends locally by letting each player control a thruster.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>38 challenging levels</strong>: Land the rocket with precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Force fields and collectables that make your life harder than it already is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer mode</strong>: Control the rocket by yourself and find a way to overcome the obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer mode</strong>: Each player gets a thruster (or more than one). Will you rely on collective intelligence or will someone take the lead?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best times:</strong>\u00a0Best times are tracked for each level.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "5 thrusters, one rocket. Can you land it safely? Touch anything and you'll die. Play by yourself or with your friends locally, each player controls a thruster. Let the insanity commence!",
